  "body": "<h2 align=\"center\">What's Changed</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3 align=\"center\">Screenshot of Neovide using the new system tabs UI on macOS</h3>\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"830\" alt=\"photo_2026-11-20 04 05 03\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ba9aa50d-e6bc-428e-89b7-b2819b144f71\" />\r\n\r\n* chore: raise minimum supported macOS version to 12 by @falcucci in https://github.com/neovide/neovide/pull/3633\r\n* bump nvim-rs 0.10 by @falcucci in https://github.com/neovide/neovide/pull/3637\r\n* feat: update support for macOS inline system tabs by @falcucci in https://github.com/neovide/neovide/pull/3639\r\n* system-tabs: make it eligible for transparent/full frames only by @falcucci in https://github.com/neovide/neovide/pull/3642\r\n* fix: finish detached UI sessions without waiting for EOF by @falcucci in https://github.com/neovide/neovide/pull/3643\r\n\r\nNeovide will always be free and open-source.\r\n\r\n[Sponsorship](https://github.com/sponsors/neovide) is highly appreciated.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/neovide/neovide/compare/0.17.2...0.17.3",
